 IDs from\nits storefront and mode. Test keys do not create real charges.",[1019,1031,1032,1033,733],{},"Expose your local webhook route through an HTTPS tunnel. Register the public\nURL and save its signing secret as ",[500,1034,1035],{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[1019,1037,1038,1039,1042,1043,1046,1047,1050],{},"Pay through a ",[997,1040,1041],{"href":326},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[500,1044,1045],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[500,1048,1049],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[1019,1052,1053],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[496,1055,1056,1059,1060,1063,1064,659,1067,1063,1070,1063,1073,1076,1077,1080,1081,1084],{},[500,1057,1058],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[500,1061,1062],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[500,1065,1066],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[500,1068,1069],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[500,1071,1072],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[500,1074,1075],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[500,1078,1079],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[500,1082,1083],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[989,1086,1088],{"id":1087},"test-your-edge-runtime","Test your edge runtime",[496,1090,1091],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[496,1093,1094,1095,1101,1102,733],{},"See the ",[997,1096,1100],{"href":1097,"rel":1098},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[1099],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[997,1103,1106],{"href":1104,"rel":1105},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[1099],"Test Helpers API reference",[1108,1109,1110],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5